      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nxxxiv) Ex. PW1/34-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a6c52392a50b43fdb8219f90bc8ba274_129",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A copy of the status of the trademark application no. 4608188 (SMCANKURTEAS) filed by the Defendant, as downloaded from the website of the trademark registry i.e., https://ipindiaonline.gov.in/eregister/eregister.aspx, had already been file"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5fe0ed1f24934119be105ee96fc5eaf2_130",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAll the documents except Ex. PW1/1, Ex .PW1/2, Ex. PW1/4, Ex. PW1/6, Ex. PW1/7, Ex. PW1/8, Ex.\nPW1/10, Ex. PW1/11, Ex. PW1/13, Ex. PW1/15, Ex. PW1/17, Ex. PW1/18 were filed with additional documents along with the affidavit in evidence of "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4ff935fb0be44743ab6e4a952a75db24_131",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nSince PW-1 Arun Gupta was examined in chief and his cross-examination was deferred on 11.10.2022."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8706a405910f42d9801f640d575b0ec6_132",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "After that, several opportunities were granted to and availed by the defendant during the intervening period of more than one and half years but defendant had not bothered to cross-examine the PW1."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb540981704042d6afc494b39233848a_133",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Since the establishment of commercial courts was done with a view to expedite the disposal of commercial matters, however, this case is a glaring example of abuse of process by the parties."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "461389d8cc7d4e04b97a4a456b9bdc76_134",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "13. Hence, defendant's right to cross-examine the PW-1 stood closed and Plaintiff's evidence was also closed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f56c622a0a4e4583b4eac805b73ae222_135",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n14. Defendant had not lead any evidence in his defence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "170e123ce6fd4669b4c06482098b2b97_136",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. Hence, Defendant's evidence was also closed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "86de6a3d3e1649e9a94bd122e7b11829_138",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "17. In view of aforesaid arguments and submissions of the parties as well as evidence appearing on record, my issue wise findings are as under:\n1."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3f6644932a004c6eb9881a90dc5dd7e0_139",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether Plaintiff is the prior user and owner of the trademark 'NOVA' in India?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c8a8698c06c04c38975ebe5a012c6b0f_140",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "OPP The onus to prove this issue was upon the plaintiff."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "afeab4961b5a462a909d99fe4e924cca_141",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nFrom the evidence lead on record as discussed in detail in the preceding paras, it has been duly established that Plaintiff has been the prior user of trademark NOVA."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c4b291f9931744e8bdff0c572159f667_142",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, issue is accordingly answered in affirmative and decided in favour of the plaintiff and against the defendant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0a5b937b5e074e7c86e9ed5b29538a2e_143",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nSurya Marketing Co vs Smc Nova Estate Pvt. Ltd on 12 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/92795922/\n9 2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "abb7c9625bf541cfae2b2a6415459186_144",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether by using the trademark 'NOVA/SMC NOVA/SMC NOVA ESTATE' defendant has infringed the registered trademark NOVA of the Plaintiff?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e8557554e88a4980899845477d6a99cc_145",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "OPP Onus to prove this issue was also upon the plaintiff and though present defendant in its written statement had claimed to have purchased the said trademark from its erstwhile owners, however, neither the name of previous owner has been "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a6d4fea9f4a647a68eaa8a1d4c1b732e_146",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As already pleaded by the Plaintiff in the suit, he had been using the aforesaid trademark since 01.08.1992 and got the same registered on 20.08.2007, whereas, as per the defendant, he had purchased the said trademark on 25.08.2020, which w"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8eed73e8ce0c42a3a9a968fa9b38ef82_147",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Since the plea of plaintiff being user of the trademark since 01.08.1992 has remained unrebutted and unchallenged."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a4de14660a454bfbad40a99f660bbe34_148",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, present issue is also answered in affirmative and in favour of the Plaintiff and against the defendant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "11183357a99d4946a4bb42c29ccc52dd_149",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n3. Whether defendant is passing of the goods of the Plaintiff?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8b83e7a783bb4c49bf6c369b989a74a4_150",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "OPP 4. Whether use of the similar/identical trade-dress and packaging by the defendant has resulted in infringement and passing off the copyright in the packaging of the Plaintiff?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "95492caace73490887d2f29081c26875_151",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "OPP Onus to prove these issues was again upon the plaintiff."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bb972209635e409487d911cf56422ad7_152",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As held in my findings in respect of issues no. 1 and 2 above, I have no hesitation in holding that from the unrebutted and unchallenged testimony of PW1,\nit has been clearly established that defendant is passing off the goods of the Plaint"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7930c6a4559b434596fbdef150d5f54b_153",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, both the aforesaid issues are answered in affirmative and are decided in favour of plaintiff and against the defendant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "34ef21bd7f194e20bbe58b6710e4d23b_154",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n5. Whether Plaintiff is entitled to damages of Rs. Five Lakhs as claimed?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0607e857efc84b8c9398d90d7b943323_155",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "OPP Since the Plaintiff's trademark has been infringed by the defendant as has been clearly established on record, hence, I have no hesitation in holding that the Plaintiff is also entitled to the damages and keeping in view the age of the "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "202220999a9a425d912e203579affb0b_156",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A bare perusal of packaging material of both the parties makes it amply clear that colour combination as well as font and entire packaging of the defendant is almost similar and identical to that of the plaintiff."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6c0fa3b618e94bf69490a44f7a2a93f3_157",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, this issue is also answered in affirmative and is decided in favour of the Plaintiff and against the defendant holding the Plaintiff to be entitled to claim damages to the tune of Rs. 5,00,000/- and same are awarded accordingly a"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "311e15c39f744686bad6fb5e50bb699c_158",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Relief and costs 18."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2ead4daa07194fb4a4cc31ff8e60390e_159",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of my findings given to all the issues above, the suit of the Plaintiff is decreed with costs and defendant is hereby also restrained permanently from using any such packaging material, which is similar or identical to that of the p"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d827b73b5724452f83ee1dbfec60ba37_160",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nSurya Marketing Co vs Smc Nova Estate Pvt. Ltd on 12 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/92795922/\n10"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "be008d03a0a946edbc2bd63ef08eb7a9_161",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The decree sheet shall be drawn only after the deficient court fee, if any, is paid by the Plaintiff."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "87a0da52c5d945e1b6ab9d0d7a6a63ab_162",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n19. File be consigned to record room after completion of necessary legal formalities in this regard."
    }
